(text "All four service targets use the same guarded path. BF protects both S and D.\nThe guard changes state only at local power qualification, before matrix image arming.\nR2115 is reduced to 99k; exact coefficient includes both switch on-resistances.\nThis prevents retained PROG rails feeding an unpowered P15/N15 source bank." (at 15.24 262.89 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d16658ba-2fdd-4987-8583-6088ba7fac63"))
(embedded_fonts no)






)
